  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside is a scenery of green grassland. Grass rustles in the light wind, and countless flowers of all colors form a tapestry that spreads to the horizon. Far away stands a tall and precipitous crystal mountain, half-translucent and pink like a scene from dreams.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Gu Immortals surround and lock Tian Ti Mountain, they ally and settle on a junior contest for their sects rather than fighting openly. Fang Zheng is among the Immortal Crane Sect disciples tasked for that mission. He already knows Fairy Bai Hu as a famous righteous path rank six Gu Immortal, and that claiming her inheritance means gaining her blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-on-tian-ti-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A fox-tailed girl greets climbers as they enter and says the first person to ascend the mountain’s peak obtains her.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "opening-of-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside, Hu Immortal’s will seals Gu worms so climbers cannot use any Gu and can rely only on physical strength. Time flow in the blessed land differs from the outside world: one day outside is five days inside. That fox-tailed girl is the Hu Immortal land spirit. Dang Hun Mountain shocks souls more strongly nearer the peak, and the land spirit suppresses that might enough for elite disciples to attempt the climb without risk of death.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "opening-of-the-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan arrives at Hu Immortal’s Dang Hun Palace on Dang Hun Mountain after using fixed immortal travel Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_dang_hun_palace",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The land spirit then reports the blessed land’s present state to its new master.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Time flows five times faster in Hu Immortal blessed land: one day outside is five days inside. The land holds about a thousand fox groups and about four million seven hundred thousand foxes in total, with three largest groups of about eight hundred thousand each; named kinds include red fox, golden fox, cloud fox, wind fox, autumn fox, and flowing light fox. Rockmen live in the southern area. The land has an area of 4000 km2, but northern and eastern damage has already cost over 1300 km2. Earlier earthly calamities left dark flame ruins in the east, flood in the north, and a blue charm lightning shadow that still wanders the land while refusing to approach Dang Hun Mountain. Hu Immortal defended five earthly calamities before losing her life.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_rockmen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu stock at that report is over eight hundred and sixty thousand rank one Gu across about fifty-two types, over a hundred and thirty thousand rank two Gu across forty-eight types, five thousand rank three Gu across twelve types, over sixty rank four Gu across eight types, and only one rank five Gu: fox skin Gu, a common defensive Gu strong against wind and water path worms but weak in a complex battlefield. The stock is ordinary rather than elite; liquor worm or breath concealment Gu would be worth more than what is raised there.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fox_skin_gu",
        "sys_defensive_gu",
        "gu_breath_concealment_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Dang Hun palace sits green grape immortal essence, counted at seventy-eight pieces and a half. The most valuable part of the blessed land is Dang Hun Mountain itself, which Hu Immortal moved into the land, and which can produce guts Gu from gutstones for soul cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        410
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-report",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_guts_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A desolate beast swamp crab presses the mountain waist during an earthly calamity.",
      "chapters": [
        417
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "swamp-crab-calamity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Both foxes and crabs die in large numbers near Dang Hun Mountain before the crab’s soul is smashed by the mountain’s vibrations and absorbed. Afterward the land spirit reports about 666 km2 of land lost, immortal essence down to sixty-eight beads, the fox army cut from about four million seven hundred thousand to three hundred and ten thousand, and around seven hundred thousand Gu worms lost. The land spirit cleans the battlefield and preserves the swamp crab corpse.",
      "chapters": [
        418
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "swamp-crab-calamity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In an underground cave within Hu Immortal blessed land, Fang Yuan uses the light of wisdom to deduce a Gu formation that refines Bo Qing’s Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refining-bo-qings-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_bo_qing",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Gu Immortals of the ten great ancient sects break into Hu Immortal blessed land on Tian Ti Mountain, they find the land empty and cannot find Dang Hun Mountain. Hu Immortal land spirit tells Feng Jiu Ge that her master has already taken everything he needs, and that the blessed land is to be given to Feng Jin Huang.",
      "chapters": [
        1026
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "empty-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    }
  ],
